[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11800100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11800100_02_0010","text":"——啊，好痛！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11800100_02_0020","text":"～～所以不是说了吗……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11800100_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11800100_02_0030","text":"这点小事没问题～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11800100_02_0040","text":"才没有没事\n转过来一下"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11800100_02_0050","text":"受伤——倒是没有呢\n唉真是的……都淋湿了嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11800100_02_0060","text":"帮你擦干之前都不要乱动。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11800100_02_0070","text":"唔～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11800100_02_0080","text":"……冬优子真温柔啊。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11800100_02_0090","text":"如果是我的话……\n嗯～……我觉得会放着不管！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11800100_02_0100","text":"我才不管你。"}]
